FiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","color":"447777","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/22","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22/labels","id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","number":22,"title":"4.5","description":"","creator":{"login":"Sauermann","id":6299227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyOTkyMjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6299227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann","html_url":"https://github.com/Sauermann","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":3687,"state":"closed","created_at":"2024-12-19T08:51:28Z","updated_at":"2026-09-04T21:48:38Z","due_on":"2025-09-15T00:00:00Z","closed_at":"2025-09-18T17:13:14Z"},"comments":6,"created_at":"2024-11-29T09:53:17Z","updated_at":"2025-03-24T17:50:32Z","closed_at":"2025-03-24T15:05:24Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/99826","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99826","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99826.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99826.patch","merged_at":"2025-03-24T15:05:24Z"},"body":"Improve parseUtf8 performance.\r\n\r\nAll the timings are using the rdtsc instruction, the lower the better.\r\n\r\n Timings using a 9mb GLTF file from this [issue](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/98893) averaged on 6000 calls of the function. **Old len** is the current implementation with the length of the string passed in, **Old -1**  is the current implementation without the length of the string passed in. **New** is the proposed implementation.\r\n![GLTF_FileComparison](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a0226770-03f1-452a-8c93-2fb56f244e9c)\r\nWent from 3 083 895 cycles down to 1 816 624 cycles.\r\n\r\nTimings using a 6mb Ascii file from [here](https://github.com/dscape/spell/blob/master/test/resources/big.txt) averaged on 15 000 calls of the function.\r\n![UTF8File_comparison](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/83c24d50-56f4-4540-a6bd-47a7b88a80dd)\r\nWent from 50 741 668 cycles down to 30 046 082 cycles.\r\n\r\nTested the output using [utf8tests](https://github.com/flenniken/utf8tests/tree/main). Now passes all the section, except the _Null Characters_ section (being able to have a 0 byte inside a longer string), but this is to be expected as changing this would probably break a lot of usage code.\r\n\r\nRegarding tests, I had to remove the non standard ones, as it is now closer to standard. I replaced them with examples from the [unicode standard specification](https://www.unicode.org/versions/Unicode16.0.0/UnicodeStandard-16.0.pdf). \r\n\r\nSome tests from other people would be nice, as this seems pretty widely used through the engine. ","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99826/reactions","total_count":13,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":13,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99826/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}